WEBVTT

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:36.290
In the year 1999,

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:39.500
High above Macross Island in the South Pacific.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:44.320
A phenomenal event occurred in the skies which altered the course of human history.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.650
a gigantic alien spaceship.

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.360
broke through the very fabric of hyperspace.

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:04.650
on a collision course with the Earth.

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:06.060
Thank you.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:15.230
During its uncontrolled fall from the sky, the plummeting space fortress produced shockwaves of incredible force.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:03.160
The craft measured nearly three quarters of a mile in length.

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:05.100
There was no sign of the alien crew.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:10.860
The armored hull had taken the brunt of the damage, leaving much of the sophisticated technosystems intact.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:15.000
What remained of the giant battle fortress gave evidence of a civilization

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.220
that was light years ahead of Earth's most advanced thinking.

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:29.160
Global war ravaged the earth at that time, but even this devastation failed by comparison to the threat of invasion from outer space.

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:29.870
I see.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:30.720
Fire was ordered.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:34.430
and world leaders banded together to form a united Earth government.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:41.820
Under the new government, the world's most brilliant minds formed a research team to study and restore the alien space fortress.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:50.140
Deciphering parts of documents found on board, they labored to unravel the secrets of an incredibly complex technology called Robotech.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:55.310
Convinced that the scientists had solved this complex riddle, world leaders ordered a celebration.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:07.330
For 10 years, the total resources of an entire planet

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:10.020
have been focused on the restoration of the Space Fortress.

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.780
A great city had grown up around the Robotech project.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:21.640
And today, on the eve of the ship's maiden flight, every citizen, man, woman, and child was gathering to celebrate their achievement.

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:24.670
and to witness the launching of their planet's new Defender.

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:29.940
Some big shots making their grand.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:30.400
the entrance.

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:33.280
Captain Glovel doesn't seem too happy about it.

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:40.670
Don't look so sour, Captain Glover. It's our big day.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:44.810
Surely you realize all those loyal citizens out there consider you their hero.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.810
I think you could at least wave to them.

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:48.910
All right, I'll wave.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:52.940
Countdown has begun.

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:59.980
On board the giant spaceship, the crew of raw recruits freshly graduated from the Robotech Academy is busy with the freelance.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:00.720
Launch Checklist.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:03.100
Thank you.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:08.860
The ceremony starts in 15 minutes. I hope the captain gets here in time.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.080
I hear he didn't get much sleep last night.

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:14.380
Yeah, the other officers threw a farewell party for him.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.620
They probably sat up all night telling each other war stories.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:18.860
You know how they are.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:20.890
And where were you, Claudia?

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:22.530
What are you talking about, Lisa?

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.480
You didn't come in until four this morning.

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:27.340
You must have been partying, too.

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:28.820
You jealous?

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:29.960
I had a

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.300
Late Dinner with Commander Fokker.

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:31.940
Claudia!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:32.360
What?

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:35.560
You stayed out all night knowing you both had flight duty today.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.880
So, what's the big fuss about Lisa?

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:40.300
We won't let it affect the performance of our duty.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:43.240
After all, we're not children and you're not our mother.

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:45.980
Your responsibilities to the ship come first, Claudia.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:49.470
But my private life is my business, nobody else's.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.500
Now then, let's get to work, alright?

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:52.980
Get out of here!

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:55.660
Lisa doesn't understand about men, Claudia.

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:57.200
She's in love with the spaceships.

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:58.400
Yeah, you got that right.

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:00.580
Thank you!

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:03.690
I'm not the one who keeps butting into everybody's business.

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:05.190
I'm warning you.

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:08.150
I hate to interrupt, but hadn't you better check your monitor, Commander?

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:11.150
It's an unidentified incoming aircraft, Lisa.

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:14.690
Attention, aircraft approaching on course 107.

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:18.050
Please identify yourself. Please identify yourself.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:20.450
This is Rick Hunter, invitation number 201.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:24.370
That's confirmed as an invitation from Lieutenant Commander Fokker.

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:26.310
Follow Course 5-7 for landing.

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:26.990
Roger.

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:30.000
Thank you.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:37.630
Now we present a display of aerial acrobatics, demonstrating the amazing advances we have made through robo-technology.

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:43.340
Lieutenant Commander Roy Boker, leader of the Veritech Fighter Squadron, will describe the action forms.

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:47.920
Today, you'll see how we've applied human know-how to a complex alien technology.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:56.920
Keep your eyes on planes 2 and 4, flying at speeds of 800 miles per hour, only 50 feet above the ground, they will pass within just a few yards of one another.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:59.880
Robotechnology makes such precision possible.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:03.920
Huh?

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:09.940
Is that you, Rick Hunter?

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:12.960
Voice, old buddy.

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:14.850
I understand you're a lieutenant commander.

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:16.310
You crazy!

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:17.850
Get that junk heap out of here!

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:29.880
Yeah, switch this to radio.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:30.620
only, will ya?

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:34.100
What are you trying to do, buddy? Make a perfect fool on me?

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:35.910
Nobody's perfect, Commander.

00:07:36.780 --> 00:07:40.180
You haven't changed a bit, have you? Well, this isn't your dad's amateur flying circus.

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.040
My men are real pilots.

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:44.530
I'm gonna have to make you eat those words, Commander.

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:45.510
Coming in.

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.220
Stop clowning around! Look at me!

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:49.160
Thank you.

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:29.440
Who do you think you are?

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:29.980
What were you?

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:34.600
you trying to do get yourself killed hey calm down and while we're at it where'd you learn to do that

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:39.430
anyway it was just a simple booster climb you taught me that yourself when i was just a kid

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:45.850
hey i have to admit those guys are pretty good not as good as me of course you don't have to

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:51.530
brag to me rick i know all about you're winning the amateur flying competition last year actually i've

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:57.130
wanted eight years in a row what have you been doing i was busy fighting a war i guess you didn't

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:59.930
Read about my having shot down 108 enemy players.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.300
Proud of being a killer?

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:01.980
What?

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.730
There was a war on and I was a soldier.

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:06.350
I just did my duty.

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:11.280
You promised my dad that as soon as the war was over, you'd come back to the air circus.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.560
Why did you go back on that promise, Roy?

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:17.650
I really felt guilty about letting your father down.

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:21.590
Only, this Robotech thing is so exciting, I just couldn't give it up.

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:24.330
It just gets in your blood or something. I don't know.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.050
What is Robotech, anyway?

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:28.610
Just more modern war machinery.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.510
And the aliens, huh?

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:38.380
Jason, Jason, I'm already Jason.

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:53.330
Well, Roy, I see you're still a big ladies man.

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:15.510
Blasting through a warp fold in deep space, a gigantic alien spaceship enters Earth's solar system in pursuit of the damaged Robotech vessel, which is a looted capture by slipping through the time-space continuum.

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:27.470
The command ship leads a vast armada of battle vessels manned by the Zentradi, a race of warriors bred for thousands of generations for the sole purpose of military conquest.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.460
The finder beam has locked on this planet.

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:34.130
Are you sure this is where the transmission was coming from?

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:35.690
Yes, sir. I'm positive.

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:37.800
They could have executed a refault.

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:41.920
It's doubtful, sir. There was no evidence of a second drop into hyperspace.

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:45.260
Hmm. They couldn't have gone far in their condition.

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:48.010
They would have to have landed in order to repair the ship.

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:49.890
That's a logical speculation, I think.

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:52.440
I agree. It would seem very like myself.

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:54.020
Send a scout team.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.060
This fighter's a real beauty, all right.

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:06.020
It looks great, but how does it handle?

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:09.780
Well, why don't you just climb aboard and see for yourself?

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:10.760
You mean that?

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:13.490
Sure. I'll go along and ride piggyback behind you.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.800
The controls may look pretty complicated, but I'll check you out on them.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:19.980
I'm not worried. If you can learn to fly one of these things, I can.

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:20.960
Don't be so modest.

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:25.490
This is a day that we've all been looking forward to for ten years.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:29.970
The Robotech Project has been a tremendous asset to the economy of Macross City.

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:32.970
Excuse me, sir. Urgent message from the Space Monitoring Station.

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:37.910
A strange flash of light and an explosion followed by irregularities in the gravitational field.

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:42.780
The same sort of thing happened ten years ago. You know what happened then, don't you?

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.840
That's when the alien ship arrived.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:46.230
Better check it out.

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:51.020
You are commanded to stay tuned for the return of Robotech.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:55.550
Attention, Robotech has returned.

00:11:58.770 --> 00:11:59.970
Every system aboard the ship.

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:10.220
is starting up. The defense system is activating the main guns to fire. Shut down all systems.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:28.620
It doesn't work. Have you control them? What do we do?

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:56.980
Now we know for sure that the ship is on that planet. All ships continue advancing and exercise extreme caution.

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:17.460
Control now. What happened, sir?

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:25.550
What's those fireworks about?

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.420
I don't know. I better go check.

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:29.450
Wait here. I'll see what's going on.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:34.790
The space monitor report is coming in.

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:37.210
It shows what our guns were firing at.

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:38.600
I have it here, Sammy.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:43.820
Two large objects, probably spaceships, in lunar orbit, 200,000 miles out.

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:48.130
Both objects were struck dead center by the beam and were disintegrated.

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:48.900
Huh?

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:59.960
It was so...

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:04.850
How obvious. We should have known. A booby trap, of course.

00:14:05.270 --> 00:14:06.350
Booby trap, sir?

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:09.740
Yes, it's one of the oldest tricks in military history.

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:13.200
A retreating enemy leaves behind hidden explosives and such.

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:19.100
The aliens who abandoned this ship armed it with an automatic defense system designed to detect and destroy their enemies.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:25.630
The activation of the guns means that unfriendly forces have approached close enough to be a threat to us.

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:29.620
Yes, what is it, Sammy?

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:38.450
I was just holding it. I wasn't going to light it. Scramble all the fighters and prepare for combat

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:03.130
on bearing Niner Zero. Commence

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:03.490
firing.

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:35.610
Very heavy resistance, sir.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:39.180
Yes, but why are they using such primitive weapons?

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.270
Our scout ships have broken through.

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:43.920
It's unbelievable.

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:45.480
Some sort of trick, no doubt.

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:46.880
Yes, it is possible.

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:48.620
It makes no sense.

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:51.160
There has to be a reason, but it's beyond me.

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:53.020
Surely the robotic masters.

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:53.880
Commander, three time.

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.920
The two enemy space cruisers are approaching.

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.220
They may be the ones who launch the missile bombardment.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:15:59.620
Blast them to bits.

00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:09.990
Those idiots behave as though they don't even know how to use their own weapons!

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:10.650
Ha ha!

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:12.380
Full barrage, all cannons.

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:36.470
Armor 2 is destroyed and Armor 10 is heavily damaged, sir.

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:39.740
I had hoped this moment wouldn't come in my lifetime.

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:47.570
After we finally achieved peace on our planet, now we face annihilation by alien forces whose power is beyond our imagination.

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:51.580
I hoped that war was a thing of the past.

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:53.480
But here we go again.

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:56.510
All right, move out.

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:57.050
Yes, sir.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:58.880
All forces move out!

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:05.290
It's in sector 412.

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:06.650
This is not a drill.

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:07.290
Thank you.

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:08.340
It's not a trail.

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:11.080
All forces proceed at once in battle formation.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.860
Well, boys, you heard her. This is the real thing.

00:17:25.180 --> 00:17:25.760
Go team ready.

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.990
All right, man. This is it. Let's go.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.550
Thank you.

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:45.310
What a disorderly arrangement. These people are completely ignorant of space war tactics.

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:46.990
What?

00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:49.810
That's Sor's Battle Fortress, but what's happened to it?

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.280
It appears to have been completely remodeled.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:54.680
Perhaps by the inhabitants of that planet.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.940
Mere Micronians couldn't possibly have captured a Robotech ship.

00:17:58.060 --> 00:17:59.960
Maybe it crashed on their planet.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.660
and they managed to salvage it.

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.880
What about the crew? They wouldn't just let them have it.

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:05.500
Maybe they were killed in the trip.

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:08.460
Even so, the ship would have been seriously damaged

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:10.980
and these primitives wouldn't have the technology to repair it.

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:14.460
I know, sir. But is there any other explanation?

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:16.140
It is a robotic vessel.

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:18.620
Hmm. We know that, uh...

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:19.580
Reflex weaponry.

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:21.720
Precisely. And this makes them very dangerous,

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:23.180
so we must exercise caution.

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:26.070
Hmm. Target pinpointed.

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:27.490
Munching fighters.

00:18:58.250 --> 00:18:58.490
Me!

00:18:58.730 --> 00:18:58.950
You

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:11.050
What do you mean take off? The runway is demolished.

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:12.430
Runway two is clear.

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:16.650
You're fully armed and your jets are overheating, so prepare for immediate takeoff.

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.400
All set, sir. Good hunting.

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:24.650
Well, okay, if you insist.

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:07.260
fighter, except invaders at zone 428.

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:09.150
Traffic's pretty heavy out here, so

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:11.050
break formation, but try to keep each other

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:14.700
covered. Hey, Foker, would

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:16.800
you mind telling me what's going on around here?

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:20.250
Who's that? Rick.

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:22.380
How's it feel to be a fighter pilot?

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:24.900
What are you talking about, big brother? I'm not

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:26.960
a fighter pilot. Whoa! Rick!

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:28.580
Hang on, Rick. I'm coming.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:36.530
Yeah, I'm okay.

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:39.210
Don't worry. Combat flying's scary for everybody.

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:41.620
You'll be all right, though.

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:45.080
You'll find it's not that much different from the good old days with the flying circus.

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:50.510
Yeah, but I never got shot at at the circus, Roy.

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:52.150
You'll get used to it.

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:55.470
Just tango on behind me for a while, if you can keep up with me.

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:58.390
If I can, I'll do my best not to leave you behind.

00:20:58.630 --> 00:20:59.970
That's the spirit. Let's go.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:00.660
Get him, little brother.

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:26.000
I've had it, Roy! I'm getting no response from the controls at all!

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:29.790
This is SDF One Control.

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:32.210
We're calling VF102. Pull out!

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:33.960
You're diving right at us.

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:38.380
Tell me something, I don't know. I can't pull out. All the controls have lost their power.

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:41.300
Have you tried switching to configuration B?

00:21:42.060 --> 00:21:42.280
B!

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:43.260
What's that mean?

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:44.590
Don't know

00:21:45.350 --> 00:21:46.050
Impossible!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:51.130
All right, listen. Pull down the control mark B on the left side of your console.

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:52.230
Okay, I found it.

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:56.350
What's it doing?

00:22:37.860 --> 00:22:41.720
In the next episode of Robotech, the aliens strike in full force

00:22:41.720 --> 00:22:45.940
and the desperate battle for the planet Earth reaches the very streets of Macross City.

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:51.250
Human courage and skill are tested to the limit against the superior weapons of the Zentradi.

00:22:52.490 --> 00:22:55.830
An heroic rescue attempt turns into a nightmare experience.

00:22:56.090 --> 00:22:59.910
Don't miss the incredible action and suspense of Countdown, the next.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:02.080
Drilling chapter in the saga of Robotech.

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:04.590
Thank you.
